1. pc.Commands (line 153): PollingConfig no longer has Commands field. Removed entire safety gate block.
2. v.State (line 263): Vehicle no longer has State field. Removed state-based early return.
   Vehicle state now lives in vehicle_live_state table, not on the Vehicle model.
   wakeIfNeeded now always attempts wake — WakeUp is idempotent, returns fast if already online.
3. pc.WakeUp (line 268): PollingConfig no longer has WakeUp field. Removed safety gate.
4. v.State in log (line 282): Removed Str('state', v.State) from log line.
5. fresh.State in poll (line 316): Removed entire polling loop — can't check state from Vehicle model.
   Tesla WakeUp call is blocking/idempotent; success indicated by nil error return.

